    "Description": "This is a autoloadable interface module for GD, a popular library for creating and manipulating PNG files.  With this library you can create PNG images on the fly or modify existing files.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* perl-GD: perl-GD: Arbitrary command execution and file overwrite via crafted filenames (CVE-2026-11526)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
